ices\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-6\",\n   \"text\": \"Provide staff with operational order queues and delivery information\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-7\",\n   \"text\": \"Provide management with basic sales and product reporting\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-8\",\n   \"text\": \"Maintain an auditable history of orders, invoices, customer accounts, and catalogue changes\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-9\",\n   \"text\": \"Implement customer authentication with sign-in, password reset, and account management\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-10\",\n   \"text\": \"Build product catalogue with search, filtering, categories, and vehicle compatibility\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-11\",\n   \"text\": \"Implement customer-specific pricing and price list management\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-12\",\n   \"text\": \"Manage stock availability with ERP CSV imports\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-13\",\n   \"text\": \"Build basket and checkout workflow with delivery date rules\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-14\",\n   \"text\": \"Implement order management with status tracking and staff editing capabilities\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-15\",\n   \"text\": \"Build customer order history, cancellation, and repeat order functionality\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-16\",\n   \"text\": \"Implement invoice creation, viewing, PDF download, and payment tracking\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-17\",\n   \"text\": \"Build administrative tools for product, user, category, and price list management\"\n  }\n ],\n \"touchesUi\": true\n}\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"answers\" kind=\"answers\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-1\",\n  \"question\": \"Is the Customer Account Manager role part of the first release, and if not, which company-level views do buyers get?\",\n  \"answer\": \"No Account Manager role in release 1; every buyer sees all orders and invoices of their own company\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-2\",\n  \"question\": \"How is an invoice's Overdue status worked out?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Due date = invoice date + one configurable payment-terms number of days; Unpaid becomes Overdue after that\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-3\",\n  \"question\": \"Can customers create or edit their own delivery addresses?\",\n  \"answer\": \"No; addresses are managed by staff/admin and customers only choose one\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-4\",\n  \"question\": \"Are prices and invoice totals tax-exclusive, and is tax shown on invoices?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Prices are net; the invoice adds one configurable tax rate and shows the tax line\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-5\",\n  \"question\": \"How should changes to catalogue items and customer accounts be recorded?\",\n  \"answer\": \"One generic audit log entry per change (who, when, entity, field before/after), viewable by admins\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-6\",\n  \"question\": \"Every buyer now sees all of their company's orders. Can a buyer cancel or repeat an order that a colleague placed?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Any active buyer of the company can cancel (while Received) or repeat any company order\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-7\",\n  \"question\": \"What happens when a product is not on the customer's assigned price list?\",\n  \"answer\": \"The product is shown but marked as having no price and cannot be added to the basket\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-8\",\n  \"question\": \"What happens at checkout if the price changed after an item was added to the basket?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Checkout shows the updated price and the customer must review it again before submitting\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"assumptions\" kind=\"assumptions\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-2\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-13\",\n   \"I-15\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-1\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Saved basket templates (section 16) are in the request but in none of the listed goals. Are they in scope for this build? → assumed: Out of scope for this build; repeat order covers re-ordering\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"reporting\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-3\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-7\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-2\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"What does 'basic sales and product reporting' for management cover beyond the staff dashboard counts? → assumed: On-screen lists with filters and CSV export; no custom report builder.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-4\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-3\",\n   \"I-11\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-3\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"How should a product with no price on the customer's assigned price list be shown? → assumed: Show it with 'Price on request' and block adding it to the basket\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-5\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-3\",\n   \"I-12\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-4\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Where does the 'low stock' quantity threshold come from? → assumed: One system-wide threshold that admins can change in system settings\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-6\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-12\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-5\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"If an ERP CSV contains product identifiers the portal doesn't recognise, what should the import do? → assumed: Apply the matching rows, skip and list the unknown identifiers, and mark the import as succeeded with warnings\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-7\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-12\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-6\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How does the nightly ERP CSV reach the portal? → assumed: The ERP drops the file into a configured folder or SFTP location that the portal reads on a schedule\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-8\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-3\",\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-7\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"Can a customer order more than the imported stock quantity of an in-stock or low-stock product? → assumed: No; the order is limited to the imported quantity, and out-of-stock products can't be added\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-9\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-8\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Which timezone and which non-working days apply to the 14:00 delivery cutoff? → assumed: One configured business timezone, with weekends plus an admin-maintained list of holiday dates as non-working days\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-13\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-14\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-9\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Does a staff rejection need its own 'Rejected' status? → assumed: No; a rejection becomes Cancelled with a stored reason\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-14\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-10\",\n   \"I-17\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-10\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Are categories flat or nested? → assumed: Flat, one level\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-15\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-9\",\n   \"I-17\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-11\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How long do password-reset links and invitation links last, and can invitations be resent? → assumed: Configurable expiry (default 1 hour for reset, 7 days for invitations); admins can resend an invitation, which cancels the old link\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"sign-in\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-16\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-9\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-12\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Can a user who is locked out request a password reset? → assumed: Email and password, with a reset link by email; no social or single sign-on.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-18\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-13\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Does the basket persist across sessions and devices? → assumed: Saved per user on the server, kept across sessions\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"notifications\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-19\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-14\",\n   \"I-1\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-14\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Who receives order emails (confirmation, amendment, rejection, out for delivery), including for staff-created orders? → assumed: Email only, from fixed templates; no SMS or push.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-20\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-2\",\n   \"I-10\",\n   \"I-17\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-15\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Where does vehicle compatibility data come from? → assumed: Admins enter it by hand per product in the portal\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"data-migration\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-21\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-10\",\n   \"I-11\",\n   \"I-17\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-16\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"Do existing customers, products, prices or past orders need to be loaded before go-live? → assumed: No; the system starts empty, with seed data for set-up.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-22\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-9\",\n   \"I-17\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-17\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"What happens to users and orders when a customer company is set to inactive? → assumed: Its users can't sign in or order; history is kept and visible to staff\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-23\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-5\",\n   \"I-16\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-18\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Should the customer invoice list only ever contain invoices for Delivered orders? → assumed: Yes; invoices exist only from Delivered onwards, and orders not yet delivered show no invoice\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-6\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-5\",\n   \"I-16\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-19\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"When can a customer see an invoice, and which invoices appear in their list? → assumed: Invoices appear only once the order is Delivered (when they are created); customers then see all their company's invoices with payment status\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-8\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-15\",\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-20\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Are saved basket templates private to the buyer who made them or shared across the company? → assumed: Templates are private to the buyer who created them\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"notifications\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-9\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-14\",\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-21\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Who receives the order emails (confirmation, quantity change, rejection, out for delivery), including for orders staff create? → assumed: Email only, from fixed templates; no SMS or push.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-12\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-12\",\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-22\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"Does placing an order hold or reduce the portal's stock figures? → assumed: No reservation; checkout checks quantities against the latest imported stock and staff check again at confirmation\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-13\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-23\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"How are the delivery-date timezone, the 14:00 cut-off and public holidays set? → assumed: One configured timezone, a configurable cut-off time (default 14:00), and public holidays entered by admins as non-working dates\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-14\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-12\",\n   \"I-3\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-24\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How is 'Low stock' worked out? → assumed: One global configurable threshold quantity\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-15\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-12\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-25\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How does the ERP stock CSV reach the portal? → assumed: A nightly scheduled pickup from a configured folder or SFTP location\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-16\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-12\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-26\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n 